  {
   "type": "H1",
   "text": "Quarterly Accessibility Report"
  },
  {
   "type": "P",
   "text": "Office of Digital Services \u00b7 Q3 2026"
  },
  {
   "type": "H2",
   "text": "Summary"
  },
  {
   "type": "P",
   "text": "During the third quarter the office remediated 1,240documents and reviewed 86 web properties. Conformancerose from 37% to 52% of top-viewed documents."
  },
  {
   "type": "H2",
   "text": "Methods"
  },
  {
   "type": "P",
   "text": "Documents were assessed with automated checks andmanual screen-reader review using NVDA and VoiceOver."
  },
  {
   "type": "H2",
   "text": "Findings"
  },
  {
   "type": "List",
   "items": [
    "Scanned PDFs remain the largest category of failures.",
    "Untagged forms announce unlabeled edit boxes.",
    "Reading order errors affect 1 in 5 multi-column pages."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "H2",
   "text": "Next steps"
  },
  {
   "type": "P",
   "text": "Prioritize benefits letters and forms for remediation beforeApril 2027."
